{"id":"H0041","lemma":"אֲבִינָדָב","transliteration":"avinadav","sayIt":"a-vi-na-DAV","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Abinadab","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Sa.7.1;\nfather of: Eleazar (H0499H), Uzzah (H5798A), Ahio (H0283)\n§ Abinadab = \"my father is noble\" or \"my father is willing\"\n1) a man of Gibeah who sheltered the ark\n2) second son of Jesse, David's older brother\n3) a son of Saul, slain with him by the Philistines","glosses":["abinadab","abinadab’s"],"count":11,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1sa-7","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab’s","kjv":"of Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-16","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-17","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Abinadab","kjv":"unto him Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-31","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"and Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abinadab","kjv":"of Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":4,"renderings":{"kjv":"of Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"and Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"and Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"and Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-10","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abinadab","kjv":"and Abinadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-13","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Abinadab","kjv":"of Abinadab"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Samuel 7:1","note":"The men of Kiriath Jearim came and took Yahweh’s ark, and brought it into Abinadab’s house on the hill, and consecrated Eleazar his son to keep Yahweh’s ark.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 6:3","note":"They set God’s ark on a new cart, and brought it out of Abinadab’s house that was on the hill; and Uzzah and Ahio, the sons of Abinadab, drove the new cart.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:13","note":"and Jesse became the father of his firstborn Eliab, and Abinadab the second, and Shimea the third,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H4324","lemma":"מִיכַל","transliteration":"mikhal","gloss":"Michal"},{"id":"H3440","lemma":"יִשְׁוִי","transliteration":"yishvi","gloss":"Ishvi"},{"id":"H0026","lemma":"אֲבִיגַ֫יִל, אֲבִיגַ֫ל","transliteration":"avigayil","gloss":"Abigail"},{"id":"H0499","lemma":"אֶלְעָזָר","transliteration":"elazar","gloss":"Eleazar"},{"id":"H5798","lemma":"עֻזָּא","transliteration":"uzza","gloss":"Uzzah"},{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H7586","lemma":"שָׁאוּל","transliteration":"shaul","gloss":"Saul"},{"id":"H0293","lemma":"אֲחִינֹ֫עַם","transliteration":"achinoam","gloss":"Ahinoam"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0041H","gloss":"Abinadab","relation":"H0041H ="},{"id":"H0041I","gloss":"Abinadab","relation":"H0041I ="},{"id":"H0041J","gloss":"Abinadab","relation":"H0041J ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}